  <ui-tests>
    <ui-test>The control renders on the OOB `sprk_communication`/thread form with NO console errors (verified via the `ui-test` skill against the deployed control).</ui-test>
    <ui-test>Dark mode: the timeline renders correctly when the model-driven app is in dark theme (Fluent v9 tokens pass through).</ui-test>
    <ui-test>A new inbound message (added to the thread) appears in the rendered control within one poll cycle (~5s) without a manual form refresh.</ui-test>
  </ui-tests>

  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">A `CommunicationTimeline` PCF exists in `src/client/pcf/` that mounts the shared component and resolves `threadId`/`authenticatedFetch`/`bffBaseUrl` from PCF context.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">The manifest declares React 16/17 platform libraries; React 18 is NOT bundled (ADR-022).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">The produced bundle contains NO `@azure/communication-*` dependency (NFR-04, grep/inspect-verified).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">`npm run build:prod` builds clean; a solution ZIP is packed and imported via `pcf-deploy`; the control is placed on the OOB form.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">UI tests pass: renders without console errors, dark-mode correct, reflects a new inbound message within one poll cycle.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <notes>
    Depends only on task 060 (the component). Blocks nothing directly, but is the delivery vehicle for the R1 message surface (spec Success Criterion 1). The send/respond accessory PCFs are task 062; the quoting action is task 063.

    If the deploy leg cannot complete in the environment (auth/import), package + validate the solution ZIP and hand the `pac solution import` + form-config remainder to the owner (mirror how email-r4 task 043 split packaging from the owner-run import) — document the split in `current-task.md`. The build + no-ACS-SDK + platform-libs checks MUST still pass.
